{"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","manifest_sha256":"dc91349a8a66fbbd64cb49a4a68fc27404ac200b38ed9f5d7a8b947873a41f53","samples":[{"reason":"分层特征：EDITORIAL","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":1,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":20.77},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":20.77}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"EDITORIAL","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":50,"start":24,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:14"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:1","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00001","text":"第 一 回 \n甄士隐梦幻识通灵 贾雨村风尘怀闺秀 \n","text_sha256":"019ee86e6bf7f9b34a67881b8525ba6f64fc6bb3e81360a09865acb341e2ddc4"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00001","text_sha256":"019ee86e6bf7f9b34a67881b8525ba6f64fc6bb3e81360a09865acb341e2ddc4"},{"reason":"分层特征：ZHIPI","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":1,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":192,"start":56,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:14"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:1","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00003","text":"庚此开卷第一回也。作者自云：因曾历过一番梦幻之后，\n故将真事隐去，而借通灵之说，撰此《石头记》一书也，故曰\n“甄士隐”云云。但书中所记何事何人？自又云：“今风尘碌\n碌，一事无成，忽念及当日所有之女子，一一细考较去，觉其\n行止见识皆出于我之上。何我堂堂须眉，诚不若此裙钗哉？","text_sha256":"60ac17550dd4e0ba221dcd8195ee8874046da3985e0e504043bf460545d60113"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00003","text_sha256":"60ac17550dd4e0ba221dcd8195ee8874046da3985e0e504043bf460545d60113"},{"reason":"分层特征：MAIN_TEXT","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":1,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":549,"start":528,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:14"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:1","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00008","text":" \n \n  列位看官，你道此书从何而来？\n","text_sha256":"36e468a31f83e15d9a1f9ded5e1f420f7d3de342c28562f9385a4e39408cda58"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00008","text_sha256":"36e468a31f83e15d9a1f9ded5e1f420f7d3de342c28562f9385a4e39408cda58"},{"reason":"逐回正文边界和原件定位抽查","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":1,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":480,"start":386,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:15"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:1","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00035","text":"说说笑笑来至峰下，坐\n于石边，高谈快论。先是说些云山雾海、神仙玄幻之事，后便\n说到红尘中荣华富贵。此石听了，不觉打动凡心，也想要到人\n间去享一享这荣华富贵，但自恨粗蠢，不得已，便口吐人言，","text_sha256":"c30bc938ca20799f80bb8175ed311ba975fafaba9dd66147f212362a9ef2b113"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:1:p00035","text_sha256":"c30bc938ca20799f80bb8175ed311ba975fafaba9dd66147f212362a9ef2b113"},{"reason":"逐回正文边界和原件定位抽查","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":5,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":158,"start":36,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:81"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:5","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:5:p00049","text":"再来。贾蓉之妻秦氏便忙笑回道：“我们这里有给宝叔收拾下\n的屋子，老祖宗放心，只管交与我就是了。”又向宝玉的奶娘\n丫鬟等道：“嬷嬷姐姐们，请宝叔随我这里来。”贾母素知秦\n氏是个极妥当的人，生得袅娜纤巧，行事又温柔和平，乃重孙\n媳中第一个得意之人，","text_sha256":"1934f050ccf70406a48ab05c8371c2312e9d3deea02780d94b0c1a663c37581a"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:5:p00049","text_sha256":"1934f050ccf70406a48ab05c8371c2312e9d3deea02780d94b0c1a663c37581a"},{"reason":"逐回正文边界和原件定位抽查","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":219,"start":113,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自悲泣，忽听院门响处，只见宝钗出来了，\n宝玉、袭人一群人送了出来。待要上去问着宝玉，又恐当着众\n人问，羞了他倒不便，因而闪过一旁，让宝钗去了，宝玉等进\n去关了门，方转过来，犹望着门洒了几点泪。","text_sha256":"bb1bb841a7e91131243f1250a1850089b9f1f92672c65bbbf3dd4dac41fb1201"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00004","text_sha256":"bb1bb841a7e91131243f1250a1850089b9f1f92672c65bbbf3dd4dac41fb1201"},{"reason":"逐回正文边界和原件定位抽查","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":67,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":649,"start":56,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:897"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:67","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00002","text":" \n \n \n  话说尤三姐自戕之后，尤老娘以及尤二姐、贾珍、尤氏并\n贾蓉、贾琏等闻之，俱各不胜悲恸伤感，自不必说，忙着人治\n买棺木盛殓，送往城外埋葬。却说柳湘莲见尤三姐身亡，迷性\n不悟，尚有痴情眷恋，被道人数句偈言打破迷关，竟自削发出\n家，跟随疯道人飘然而去，不知何往。后事暂且不表。 \n  且说薛姨妈闻知湘莲已说定了尤三姐为妻，心甚喜悦，正\n自高高兴兴要打算替他买房屋、治器用、办妆奁，择吉日迎娶\n过门等事，以报他救命之恩。忽有家中小厮见薛姨妈，告知尤\n三姐自戕与柳湘莲出家的信息，心甚叹息。正自猜疑是为什么\n原故，时值宝钗从园子里过来，薛姨妈便对宝钗说道：“我的\n儿，你听见了没有？你珍大嫂子的妹妹尤三姐，他不是已经许\n定了给你哥哥的义弟柳湘莲的？这也很好。不知为什么尤三姐\n自刎了，柳湘莲也出了家了。真正奇怪的事，叫人意想不到！”\n宝钗听了，并不在意，便说道：“俗语说的好，‘天有不测风\n云，人有旦夕祸福’。这也是他们前生命定，活该不是夫妻。\n妈所为的是因有救哥哥的一段好处，故谆谆感叹。如果他两人\n齐齐全全的，妈自然该替他料理，如今死的死了，出家的出了\n家了，依我说，也只好由他罢了。妈也不必为他们伤感，损了\n自己的身子。倒是自从哥哥起江南回来了一二十日，贩了来的\n货物，想来也该发完了，那同伴去的伙计们辛辛苦苦的，来回\n几个月，妈同哥哥商议商议，也该请一请，酬谢酬谢才是。不\n","text_sha256":"7d9ec54d7ef55b23189c054395873625fc91a2951ca1223dfb3424f528e58155"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00002","text_sha256":"7d9ec54d7ef55b23189c054395873625fc91a2951ca1223dfb3424f528e58155"},{"reason":"特殊排版／异文／校读字形：物理页 916","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":67,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER","INVISIBLE_TEXT","WATERMARK_FONT"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"FZGLFW--GB1-0-GBK-EUC-H","size":10.38},{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":10.38},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11},{"color":16777215,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":1.18},{"color":2301728,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":10.38}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"EDITORIAL","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":751,"start":717,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:914"},{"end":189,"start":0,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:915"},{"end":45,"start":0,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:916"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:67","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00037","text":"①按：此回庚辰本缺。其他各本存在两种类型文字，且出入较大。列、戚、\n撫琴居红楼梦脂评汇校本 \nredactor: kolistan \n904\n甲辰本此回情节安排完整合理，但较为罗嗦拖沓，玩其文字，当非出于曹雪芹手\n笔，或系脂砚等人据曹雪芹残稿补写而成。蒙、杨本及程甲乙本一系文字比较简\n练，显系经过后人整理，且存在删减过度及某些情节欠合理的问题。由于两种版\n本文字多寡悬殊，无法互校，故本书正文依据早出的列藏本，另将程甲本文字附\n录于下。 \n \n第六十七回 馈土物颦卿念故里 讯家童凤姐蓄阴谋 \nwww.hlmbbs.com \n905\n","text_sha256":"12c5dacc64be7258dfffd06d44dae1dbdd54a49b15978f30f0d77d4205b4c6cc"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00037","text_sha256":"12c5dacc64be7258dfffd06d44dae1dbdd54a49b15978f30f0d77d4205b4c6cc"},{"reason":"分层特征：VARIANT","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":67,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_ALTERNATE_CHAPTER_SCOPE"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"VARIANT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":872,"start":45,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:916"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:67","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00038","text":"附录： \n第六十七回 见土仪颦卿思故里 闻秘事凤姐讯家童 \n \n  话说尤三姐自尽之后，尤老娘和二姐儿、贾珍、贾琏等俱不胜悲恸，自\n不必说，忙令人盛殓，送往城外埋葬。柳湘莲见尤三姐身亡，痴情眷恋，却\n被道人数句冷言打破迷关，竟自截发出家，跟随疯道人飘然而去，不知何往。\n暂且不表。 \n  且说薛姨妈闻知湘莲已说定了尤三姐为妻，心中甚喜，正是高高兴兴要\n打算替他买房子，治傢伙，择吉迎娶，以报他救命之恩。忽有家中小厮吵嚷\n“三姐儿自尽了”，被小丫头们听见，告知薛姨妈。薛姨妈不知为何，心甚\n叹息。正在猜疑，宝钗从园里过来，薛姨妈便对宝钗说道：“我的儿，你听\n见了没有？你珍大嫂子的妹妹三姑娘，他不是已经许定给你哥哥的义弟柳湘\n莲了么，不知为什么自刎了。那柳湘莲也不知往那里去了。真正奇怪的事，\n叫人意想不到。”宝钗听了，并不在意，便说道：“俗话说的好，‘天有不\n测风云，人有旦夕祸福’。这也是他们前生命定。前日妈妈为他救了哥哥，\n商量着替他料理，如今已经死的死了，走的走了，依我说，也只好由他罢了。\n妈妈也不必为他们伤感了。倒是自从哥哥打江南回来了一二十日，贩了来的\n货物，想来也该发完了，那同伴去的伙计们辛辛苦苦的，回来几个月了，妈\n妈和哥哥商议商议，也该请一请，酬谢酬谢才是。别叫人家看着无理似的。” \n  母女正说话间，见薛蟠自外而入，眼中尚有泪痕。一进门来，便向他母\n亲拍手说道：“妈妈可知道柳二哥、尤三姐的事么？”薛姨妈说：“我才听\n见说，正在这里和你妹妹说这件公案呢。”薛蟠道：“妈妈可听见说柳湘莲\n跟着一个道士出了家了么？”薛姨妈道：“这越发奇了。怎么柳相公那样一\n个年轻的聪明人，一时糊涂，就跟着道士去了呢。我想你们好了一场，他又\n无父母兄弟，只身一人在此，你该各处找找他才是。靠那道士能往那里远去，\n左不过是在这方近左右的庙里寺里罢了。”薛蟠说：“何尝不是呢。我一听\n见这个信儿，就连忙带了小厮们在各处寻找，连一个影儿也没有。又去问人，\n","text_sha256":"2403bb05e2668256c8bbeb0654cb092cb7834117c70ef491f28dbddfc34e0506"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:67:p00038","text_sha256":"2403bb05e2668256c8bbeb0654cb092cb7834117c70ef491f28dbddfc34e0506"},{"reason":"特殊排版／异文／校读字形：物理页 1097","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":80,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":18.48},{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":20.77},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":11.56},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":20.77}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"EDITORIAL","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":58,"start":27,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1097"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:80","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:80:p00001","text":"第 八 十 回 \n薛文龙悔娶河东狮 贾迎春误嫁中山狼（续）\n①","text_sha256":"d2865fe511569151050d18fbd7b0332c50c51887037bd62a74a1c64c3546ed0e"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:80:p00001","text_sha256":"d2865fe511569151050d18fbd7b0332c50c51887037bd62a74a1c64c3546ed0e"},{"reason":"逐回正文边界和原件定位抽查","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":80,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":306,"start":156,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1097"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:80","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:80:p00008","text":"拍着掌冷笑道：“菱角花\n谁闻见香来着？若说菱角香了，正紧那些香花放在那里？可是\n不通之极！”香菱道：“不独菱角花，就连荷叶莲蓬，都是有\n一股清香的。但他那原不是花香可比，若静日静夜或清早半夜\n细领略了去，那一股香比是花儿都好闻呢。就连菱角、鸡头、\n苇叶、芦根得了风露，那一股清香，就令人心神爽快的。”","text_sha256":"1a689b6af59c51c92b33a6921646c9fb39a4772d783348eea49a0df58f8da15e"},"segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:80:p00008","text_sha256":"1a689b6af59c51c92b33a6921646c9fb39a4772d783348eea49a0df58f8da15e"},{"reason":"特殊排版／异文／校读字形：物理页 1127","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":null,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["INVISIBLE_TEXT"],"styles":[{"color":16777215,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":1.18}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"EDITORIAL","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":18,"start":0,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1127"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"appendix:jing-transcription","segment_id":"hlm80:appendix:jing-transcription:p00001","text":"www.hlmbbs.com \n \n","text_sha256":"0368f575109c40fcafde7f38222fb0ea910562617770f2ac0647c05c39f4dfbb"},"segment_id":"hlm80:appendix:jing-transcription:p00001","text_sha256":"0368f575109c40fcafde7f38222fb0ea910562617770f2ac0647c05c39f4dfbb"},{"reason":"分层特征：APPENDIX","segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":null,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V1","reasons":["DECLARED_APPENDIX_SCOPE"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":10.38},{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58},{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":20.77},{"color":2301728,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":10.38},{"color":2301728,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":12.67},{"color":2301728,"font":"TimesNewRomanPSMT","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:pilot:v1","kind":"APPENDIX","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":543,"start":18,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1127"},{"end":21,"start":0,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1128"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"appendix:jing-transcription","segment_id":"hlm80:appendix:jing-transcription:p00002","text":"1116\n \n \n毛国瑶抄录靖藏本批语一百五十条 \n \n \n  所谓靖藏本，因原为扬州靖应鵾所藏而得名。此书一九五\n九年夏由毛国瑶发现，一九六四年尚在，后迷失不知下落。据\n介绍原书题“石头记”。存七十八回。缺第二十八与二十九回，\n第三十回残失三页。 \n  书发现时，毛国瑶曾将书中批语与戚本进行比较，摘录戚\n本所无的批语一百五十条，过录在横行练习簿上。后来将它发\n表于南京师范学院《文教资料简报》一九七四年八、九月号（总\n第二十一、二十二合刊）。 \n  此本中独有一些极重要的批语。如第十三回命作者删去\n“秦可卿淫丧天香楼”“遗簪、更衣诸文”的人是畸笏叟；如\n第二十二回畸笏叟所加的批语“前批知者聊聊，不数年，芹溪、\n脂砚、杏斋诸子皆相继别去。今丁亥夏，只剩朽物一枚，宁不\n痛杀！”都极有研究资料价值。此外，批语中还提供了许多先\n前不知道的八十回后的佚稿情节。 \n  由于靖本只有毛国瑶一人亲见过，近年有不少研究者怀疑\n此本并不存在。详细情况可参阅裴世安老先生编辑的《靖本资\n料》（自印本，2005 年）。 \n \n第 一 回 \n  1．作者自己形容（“生得骨格不凡，丰神迥异”句墨笔眉\n批） \n  2．补天济时勿认真作常言（女娲炼石补天一段侧批） \n附录三 毛国瑶抄录靖藏本批语一百五十条 \n","text_sha256":"cb23c32229f1d2bda4d110831905b4e25219badd6435c9fc3c6f17d0f20bad06"},"segment_id":"hlm80:appendix:jing-transcription:p00002","text_sha256":"cb23c32229f1d2bda4d110831905b4e25219badd6435c9fc3c6f17d0f20bad06"}]}
